# AI Pipeline

Canonical product decisions: [`docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`](../../docs/ARCHITECTURE.md).

## Runtime (ExecuTorch)

- STT: `useSpeechToText` + `WHISPER_TINY` via `WHISPER_MODEL` in `src/constants/models.ts`
- LLM: `useLLM` + tier constant from `LLM_MODELS` (`lite` / `standard` / `pro` → Qwen3 0.6B / 1.7B / 4B)
- Tier selection: `LLMTierSelector` + persisted `device-store` — never hardcode a model in `whisper.ts` / `llm.ts`
- Download / load: library hooks with `preventLoad` until Download Screen or pipeline triggers fetch

## Memory

Enforce exclusivity through `MemoryManager` (`acquireLock` / `releaseLock` / `forceGC`), not ad-hoc call-site checks.

- Never load Whisper and LLM at the same time
- Recording loads **no** model (mic → disk only)
- Pipeline: acquire → process → unload + `forceGC` → acquire next
- Peak RAM budget: **< 2GB** on a 3GB device
- JS/native leak hunting and Android R8: `.ai/skills/react-native-best-practices/` (does not override this section)

## Queues & audio

- Hold **file paths only** — never audio bytes in JS (`AudioChunkQueue`, `TranscriptQueue`)
- Recording writes ~30s chunks to disk (atomic rename); FFmpeg / `AudioConversionService` is **PARKED** (`ARCHITECTURE.md` §12)
- When import conversion lands, decode to 16 kHz mono WAV before Whisper

## Prompts

All prompts live in `src/services/ai/prompts.ts` only — never inline in hooks or components.

- Fixed system role (not user-overridable)
- Transcript after instructions, delimited with `---`
- Every clinical prompt includes STRICT OUTPUT RULES (format only; no preamble/epilogue)
- Anti-hallucination: do not infer findings absent from the transcript
- Missing data → `[not documented]`; never invent vitals or diagnoses

## SOAP output

Before display, LLM clinical output must pass SOAP validation (planned: `src/services/ai/output-validator.ts`).

- Reject empty or &lt; 50 char responses
- Require Subjective, Objective, Assessment, Plan
- Strip meta-text ("Here is your note", disclaimers)
- On failure → typed `Result` error + retry UI — never show raw invalid output

## Logging

Never log transcripts, SOAP output, or audio file paths in production builds.
